      "title": "ADAS",
      "body": [
        "ADAS is now standard in nearly every new make and model, transforming how repairs must be performed. These technologies are critical to vehicle safety and demand precise calibration and repair procedures. Count on I&#8209;CAR to understand ADAS components, stay current with OEM requirements, to perform complete, safe, and quality repairs every&nbsp;time."
      ],
